            "Unnamed: 20": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 21": NaN
        },
        {
            "Section": "IT.IEDAT",
            "Unnamed: 1": "IEDAT",
            "Unnamed: 2": "What was the date the eligibility criteria assessment was performed? [en]",
            "Unnamed: 3": "date",
            "Unnamed: 4": 2,
            "Unnamed: 5": "No",
            "Unnamed: 6": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 7": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 8": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": "IEDAT [en]",
            "Unnamed: 11": "IEDAT [CDASH]\nRecord complete date when the eligibility assessment was performed using this format (DD-MON-YYYY). [completionInstructions]\nA complete date is expected. The date of collection may be determined from the date of visit (VISDAT) and if so, a separate assessment date field is not required. [implementationNotes]\nThis does not map directly to an SDTMIG variable. For the SDTM submission dataset, concatenate all collected CDASH DATE and TIME components and populate the SDTMIG variable IEDTC in ISO 8601 format. [mappingInstructions]\nDate [prompt]",
