            "Unnamed: 6": "CL.IECAT",
            "Unnamed: 7": 15,
            "Unnamed: 8": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": "IECAT [en]",
            "Unnamed: 11": "IECAT [CDASH]\nRecord whether the criterion exception was Inclusion or Exclusion. Checkbox: Check Inclusion or Exclusion. [completionInstructions]\nThese categories have been defined in SDTM and have controlled terminology that must be used. Only records for criteria that are not met appear in the IE SDTMIG domain. IECAT must be populated. This criterion category may be collected on the CRF in a checkbox format or it may be included as part of the Criterion Identification and mapped when the SDTM submission datasets are created. [implementationNotes]\nMaps directly to the SDTMIG variable listed in the column with the heading SDTMIG Target. [mappingInstructions]\nCriterion Type [prompt]",
